<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Marketing Manager · Campaign &amp; GTM Execution</div>
      <h1>I keep marketing campaigns <span class="role">organized, on time, and tied to what the customer actually needs.</span></h1>
