  <section id="work" class="alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">Field notes</div>
        <h2>Four projects, in their own words</h2>
        <p>Smaller than one flagship story, but each one shows a different muscle. Click any to expand.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-list">
        <div class="cs-item reveal">
          <button class="cs-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <div class="cs-trigger-left">
              <span class="cs-index">01</span>
              <div>
                <div class="cs-title">Organizing a state adoption campaign from zero</div>
                <div class="cs-role-tag">Cross-functional orchestration</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <svg class="cs-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="cs-panel">
            <div class="cs-panel-inner">
              <div class="cs-col"><span class="col-label">Problem</span><p>A large state adoption campaign — 10+ projects and varied collateral, with staggered deadlines that carried real risk of shifting.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-col"><span class="col-label">Approach</span><p>Built the organizing structure from the ground up and hosted weekly cross-functional check-ins to track dependencies and surface risk early.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-col outcome"><span class="col-label">Outcome</span><p>On-time delivery maintained through departure, with the campaign handed off fully organized and ready for the next owner.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-item reveal">
          <button class="cs-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <div class="cs-trigger-left">
              <span class="cs-index">02</span>
              <div>
                <div class="cs-title">Turning a price increase into a resolved partner issue</div>
                <div class="cs-role-tag">Channel &amp; partner advocacy</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <svg class="cs-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="cs-panel">
            <div class="cs-panel-inner">
              <div class="cs-col"><span class="col-label">Problem</span><p>Multiple list price increases had to be delivered to a book of channel partners — an unwelcome message, more than once.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-col"><span class="col-label">Approach</span><p>Used each rollout to build deeper pricing and competitive fluency. When one partner pushed back hard, documented their feedback with supporting data and escalated it internally.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-col outcome"><span class="col-label">Outcome</span><p>Secured a partner-specific discount — frontline friction turned into a resolved, evidence-backed business case.</p></div>
