            <div class="cs-trigger-left">
              <span class="cs-index">03</span>
              <div>
                <div class="cs-title">Building customer personas that changed how the store ran</div>
                <div class="cs-role-tag">Customer insight &amp; strategy</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <svg class="cs-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="cs-panel">
            <div class="cs-panel-inner">
              <div class="cs-col"><span class="col-label">Problem</span><p>No formal understanding of who the store's customers actually were, or why they bought.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-col"><span class="col-label">Approach</span><p>Surveyed and studied the customer base directly, built out personas, and used the insights to guide decisions and brief upper management.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-col outcome"><span class="col-label">Outcome</span><p>A full year of positive comps year-over-year, driven by understanding how, when, and why customers shopped.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-item reveal">
          <button class="cs-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <div class="cs-trigger-left">
              <span class="cs-index">04</span>
              <div>
